  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/French/script/class_b_06.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_01",
      "hash64": "4C786A4AA1E1E046",
      "text": "Bonjour, tout le monde. Aujourd’hui encore,\\nessayons d’apprendre en nous amusant ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_02",
      "hash64": "4C78694AA1E1DE93",
      "text": "Rappelez-vous : lors du dernier cours, nous avons\\nétudié les augmentations de stats.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_03",
      "hash64": "4C78684AA1E1DCE0",
      "text": "Vous trouvez certainement que ces histoires\\nde multiplications et de pourcentages ne sont\\r\\npas faciles, n’est-ce pas ?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_04",
      "hash64": "4C786F4AA1E1E8C5",
      "text": "Eh bien, aujourd’hui, nous allons continuer à\\nétudier les pourcentages, mais cette fois-ci,\\r\\npour calculer des probabilités.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_05",
      "hash64": "4C786E4AA1E1E712",
      "text": "Cela peut sembler difficile dit comme ça, mais\\nau fond, vous utilisez déjà les probabilités\\r\\nsans le savoir.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_06",
      "hash64": "4C786D4AA1E1E55F",
      "text": "Avez-vous déjà entendu parler de la « précision »\\nd’une capacité ? C’est la probabilité qu’a\\r\\ncette dernière de toucher l’adversaire.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_07",
      "hash64": "4C786C4AA1E1E3AC",
      "text": "Par exemple, la précision de Charge est de 100 !\\nCela veut dire qu’elle touchera 100 % du temps.\\c\\nConcrètement, cela signifie que si vous l’utilisez\\n100 fois, elle touchera l’adversaire 100 fois.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 197,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_08",
      "hash64": "4C78734AA1E1EF91",
      "text": "En revanche, Hypnose, une capacité qui endort\\nla cible, a une précision de 60.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_09",
      "hash64": "4C78724AA1E1EDDE",
      "text": "Ainsi, si les chances que la capacité touche\\nla cible sont de 60 %, cela signifie, pour faire\\r\\nsimple, qu’en l’utilisant 100 fois, elle devrait\\r\\ntoucher 60 fois. Et donc échouer 40 fois.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 190,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_10",
      "hash64": "4C74E54AA1DEC870",
      "text": "En général, la plupart des capacités vraiment\\npuissantes ont une précision faible.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_11",
      "hash64": "4C74E64AA1DECA23",
      "text": "C’est à vous de choisir entre une capacité qui\\ntouche à coup sûr, ou une capacité plus puissante,\\r\\nmais qui risque d’échouer...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_12",
      "hash64": "4C74E74AA1DECBD6",
      "text": "Ainsi, à chaque fois que vous choisissez parmi\\nvos capacités, vous utilisez déjà les probabilités.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_13",
      "hash64": "4C74E84AA1DECD89",
      "text": "Peut-être pourrais-je utiliser l’exemple de Surf\\net Hydrocanon pour illustrer mon propos ?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_14",
      "hash64": "4C74E94AA1DECF3C",
      "text": "Surf a une précision de 100. Cela veut dire que\\nvous êtes certains d’infliger les dégâts de cette\\r\\ncapacité avec une puissance de 90.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_15",
      "hash64": "4C74EA4AA1DED0EF",
      "text": "En revanche, Hydrocanon a une puissance\\nde 110, mais sa précision n’est que de 80 ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_16",
      "hash64": "4C74EB4AA1DED2A2",
      "text": "Alors dites-moi : si vous aviez le choix entre\\nces deux capacités, laquelle utiliseriez-vous ?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_b_06_select_01",
      "hash64": "669BEC9254F0EEB0",
      "text": "Surf.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_b_06_select_02",
      "hash64": "669BEF9254F0F3C9",
      "text": "Hydrocanon.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_b_06_select_03",
      "hash64": "669BEE9254F0F216",
      "text": "L’une ou l’autre, selon la situation.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_answer_01",
      "hash64": "9038381829CEBDC7",
      "text": "Oh, je vois. Tu préfères jouer la carte\\nde la sécurité.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_answer_02",
      "hash64": "9038391829CEBF7A",
      "text": "Oh, je vois. Tu aimes prendre des risques.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_answer_03",
      "hash64": "90383A1829CEC12D",
      "text": "Oh, je vois. Tu es du genre à bien réfléchir\\nà chaque situation.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_17",
      "hash64": "4C74EC4AA1DED455",
      "text": "Quoi qu’il en soit, il n’y avait pas de bonne\\nréponse à cette question.\\c\\nC’est à vous de juger et d’utiliser les capacités\\nselon vos goûts personnels.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 152,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_18",
      "hash64": "4C74ED4AA1DED608",
      "text": "Par ailleurs, les capacités ont d’autres critères\\nqu’il ne faut pas négliger, comme les PP ou le\\r\\nnombre d’adversaires qu’elles peuvent toucher.\\c\\nLà non plus, il n’y a pas de bon ou de mauvais\\nchoix. C’est à vous de vous adapter.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 233,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_19",
      "hash64": "4C74EE4AA1DED7BB",
      "text": "Quant au débat pour savoir quelle capacité est\\nla meilleure entre Surf et Hydrocanon, il n’est\\r\\npas près d’être clos.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_20",
      "hash64": "4C7EF74AA1E73B8B",
      "text": "En ce qui me concerne, c’est surtout entre\\nÉboulement et Lame de Roc, deux capacités de\\r\\ntype Roche, que j’ai toujours tendance à hésiter.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_21",
      "hash64": "4C7EF64AA1E739D8",
      "text": "Je crois que je pourrais parler de ces capacités\\npendant des heures...\\c\\nMalheureusement, la cloche a sonné.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_b_06_math_22",
      "hash64": "4C7EF94AA1E73EF1",
      "text": "Notre prochain cours sera aussi le dernier, alors\\nje compte sur vous pour être attentifs à 100 % ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
